{"id":"178fc8cf9cbbf910","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-number-realizability-witness-extraction.md","title":"Witness extraction from a numerical realizer","display":"thm-number-realizability-witness-extraction — Witness extraction from a numerical realizer","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-number-realizability-witness-extraction","aliases":["72-thm-number-realizability-witness-extraction"],"display":"thm-number-realizability-witness-extraction — Witness extraction from a numerical realizer","depends_on":["[[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter VI, section 1.1, universal and existential clauses and explanation, printed p. 408, PDF p. 420","source_statement_checked":true,"proof_status":"proved-in-note; source-clauses-checked","source_proof_status":"Universal and existential clause expansion, graph single-valuedness and totality checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"round2_verification_status":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background","verification_status":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-number-realizability-witness-extraction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-number-realizability-witness-extraction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-number-realizability-witness-extraction — Witness extraction from a numerical realizer"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ac651a11b295edf3\" href=\"?note=ac651a11b295edf3\" title=\"72-df-kleene-number-realizability\">72-df-kleene-number-realizability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VI, section 1.1, universal and existential clauses and explanation, printed p. 408, PDF p. 420"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-clauses-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Universal and existential clause expansion, graph single-valuedness and totality checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-proof-checked-with-declared-standard-background"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal A_a\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal A_a\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,i,j\\in\\omega\">\\(e,i,j\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\ne j\">\\(i\\ne j\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NR},\\varphi,p_0,p_1\">\\(\\mathsf{NR},\\varphi,p_0,p_1\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ac651a11b295edf3\" href=\"?note=ac651a11b295edf3\" title=\"72-df-kleene-number-realizability\">72-df-kleene-number-realizability</a> 的固定结构。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_e\">\\(f_e\\)</span> 是下面显式给出的部分函数图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_e:\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(f_e:\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span> 在结论中表示该图对每个自然数恰有一个输出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f_e\\coloneqq\\{\\langle m,p_0(k)\\rangle:m,k\\in\\omega\\land\\varphi_e(m)\\downarrow=k\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f_e\\coloneqq\\{\\langle m,p_0(k)\\rangle:m,k\\in\\omega\\land\\varphi_e(m)\\downarrow=k\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NR}(e,\\forall_a x_i\\exists_a x_j A,\\eta)\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\left[\nf_e:\\omega\\to\\omega\\ \\land\\\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\n\\left(\\varphi_e(m)\\downarrow=k\\land f_e(m)=p_0(k)\\land\n\\mathsf{NR}(p_1(k),A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m][j\\mapsto f_e(m)])\\right)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{NR}(e,\\forall_a x_i\\exists_a x_j A,\\eta)\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\left[\nf_e:\\omega\\to\\omega\\ \\land\\\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\n\\left(\\varphi_e(m)\\downarrow=k\\land f_e(m)=p_0(k)\\land\n\\mathsf{NR}(p_1(k),A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m][j\\mapsto f_e(m)])\\right)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：由全称子句，对每个 m 都有唯一计算结果 k，且 k 实现更新 x_i 后的存在句。存在子句给出见证 p_0(k)，以及 p_1(k) 对矩阵 A 在两次更新环境下的实现。部分递归函数的单值性与 p_0 的全定义性保证 f_e 是单值图；前述逐 m 存在性保证其定义域为 ω，因此是全函数。组合 p_0 与部分递归程序仍部分递归，故这里获得的全函数有计算实现。结论保留矩阵的实现性；没有对任意 A 错误地推出其经典真值。该论证已在笔记中检查，来源提供这两条定义子句及见证解释，不冒充原书的另一个编号定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-kleene-number-realizability","status":"resolved","id":"ac651a11b295edf3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-kleene-number-realizability","status":"resolved","id":"ac651a11b295edf3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathcal A_a$，$\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega$，$e,i,j\\in\\omega$，$i\\ne j$；$\\mathsf{NR},\\varphi,p_0,p_1$ 采用 [[72-df-kleene-number-realizability]] 的固定结构。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal A_a","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"e,i,j\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"i\\ne j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NR},\\varphi,p_0,p_1","display":false},{"tex":"f_e","display":false},{"tex":"f_e:\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f_e\\coloneqq\\{\\langle m,p_0(k)\\rangle:m,k\\in\\omega\\land\\varphi_e(m)\\downarrow=k\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NR}(e,\\forall_a x_i\\exists_a x_j A,\\eta)\n\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n\\left[\nf_e:\\omega\\to\\omega\\ \\land\\\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\n\\left(\\varphi_e(m)\\downarrow=k\\land f_e(m)=p_0(k)\\land\n\\mathsf{NR}(p_1(k),A,\\eta[i\\mapsto m][j\\mapsto f_e(m)])\\right)\n\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":2466,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-221","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-number-realizability-witness-extraction|thm-number-realizability-witness-extraction — Witness extraction from a numerical realizer]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-221","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-number-realizability-witness-extraction|thm-number-realizability-witness-extraction — Witness extraction from a numerical realizer]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-313","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-thm-number-realizability-witness-extraction|72-thm-number-realizability-witness-extraction]]"}],"outgoing":["ac651a11b295edf3"]}